# Loaded by `next dev` only (never by `next build` or `next start`), so production never sees it.
# Pilot flags (roadmap 0.3) are on in demo/dev so the owner can see unfinished pilot work locally.
# "pilot" turns on every pilot flag; "all" never does. A value in .env.local replaces this one:
# add "pilot" there too if you set NEXT_PUBLIC_FEATURES yourself.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FEATURES=pilot
